              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyakuba yisibonakaliso nobufakazi kuJehova Sebawoti ezweni laseGibithe; ngoba bayombiza uJehova ngenxa yabacindezeli, futhi uyobathumelela umsindisi nomkhulu, futhi uyobakhulula.",
          "type": "text",
