              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova uyokwaziwa eGibhithe, futhi abaseGibhithe bayomazi uJehova ngalolo suku, futhi bayoletha iminikelo neminikelo eyenziwa ngomlilo; yebo, kumelwe benze isithembiso kuJehova futhi basigcwalise.",
          "type": "text",
