              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolo suku kuyakuba khona umgwaqo omkhulu ophuma eGibithe uya e-Asiriya, i-Asiriya lingene eGibithe, abaseGibithe baye e-Asiriya, abaseGibithe bakhonze kanye ne-Asiriya.",
          "type": "text",
